          "use": "pt-pt",
          "notes": "Verb: _iterar_; \"percorrer cada elemento\" also natural.",
          "anchor": "term-iteration"
        },
        {
          "en": "to run / execute (code)",
          "target": "executar / correr",
          "use": "pt-pt",
          "notes": "`correr` in warm/casual register (\"experimenta correr este código\"); `executar` in formal or procedural steps. Deliberately diverges from Brazilian \"rodar\", which is not natural European Portuguese usage.",
          "anchor": "term-to-run-execute"
        },
        {
          "en": "loop",
          "target": "ciclo",
          "use": "pt-pt",
          "notes": "Deliberately diverges from Brazilian \"laço\". Source: Univ. Évora, FEUP course descriptions. `for`/`while` keywords stay English.",
          "anchor": "term-loop"
        },
        {
          "en": "scope",
          "target": "âmbito",
          "use": "pt-pt",
          "notes": "Deliberately diverges from Brazilian \"escopo\".",
          "anchor": "term-scope"
        }
      ]
    },
